cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use Easy Quadrat, please cite it using the metadata below."
title: "Easy Quadrat"
type: software
version: "2.0.0"
abstract: >-
  Easy Quadrat is a desktop application for defining, cropping, and segmenting
  quadrat-based sampling regions in crop images using manual selection,
  proportional fixed-frame cropping, classical image processing, and YOLO-based
  instance segmentation. The Easy Quadrat application source is distributed
  under the MIT License. YOLO-related components and trained model weights are
  subject to separate third-party licensing terms described in the repository.
authors:
  - family-names: Haghshenas
    given-names: Abbas
keywords:
  - crop phenotyping
  - plant phenotyping
  - quadrat sampling
  - image processing
  - image segmentation
repository-code: "https://github.com/haqueshenas/Easy-Quadrat"
